          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দোষ — dosh — \"a fault; blame\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এটা তোমার দোষ নয়। eṭā tomār dosh nôy. It's not your fault."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দোষ (dosh) is Sanskrit doṣa, a fault or defect (Monier-Williams). It belongs to the one at fault: তোমার দোষ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
